 ],
 "storyArc": "With Vale away, Hernando asks Tomás to help him write his memoir: fifty years of Bogotá from the front seat of a taxi and the corner table of a café. Choosing every tense on purpose becomes their game: what happened, what used to happen, what would have happened if he had told Rosa. Hernando's chapters are funnier and sadder than anything Tomás has read."
